# The last matching line wins. The vault's maintainers own the policy, the
# workflow and anything no domain claims; each domain under notes/ is owned
# by the team that knows it. Turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in
# the branch protection rule so a note change needs its domain's approval.
*                     @example-org/brain-maintainers
/notes/platform/      @example-org/platform
/notes/security/      @example-org/security
/.brain/              @example-org/brain-maintainers
/.github/             @example-org/brain-maintainers
